msgid "Definition of Molpro input language"
msgstr "Molpro 输入语言定义"

msgid "Input format"
msgstr "输入格式"

msgid ""
"Molpro’s execution is controlled by an input file. In general, each input "
"record begins with a keyword, which may be followed by data or other "
"keywords. Molpro input contains commands, directives, options and data. The "
"commands and directives are sequentially executed in the order they are "
"encountered. Furthermore, procedures can be defined anywhere in the input, "
"which can include any number of commands and directives. They are only "
"executed when called (which may be before or after the definition in the "
"input file)."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 的执行由一个输入文件控制。通常，每个输入记录以一个关键词开始，后面可以跟随数据或其他关键词。Molpro "
"输入包含命令、指令、选项和数据。命令和指令按照它们出现的顺序依次执行。此外，可以在输入的任何位置定义过程，这些过程可以包含任意数量的命令和指令。它们仅在调用时执行（调用可能发生在输入文件中定义之前或之后）。"

msgid ""
"The input file can be written in free format. The following conversions take"
" place:"
msgstr "输入文件可以采用自由格式编写。会发生以下转换："

msgid "**, (comma)** move to next tab stop, i.e. this delimits input fields"
msgstr "**, (逗号)** 移动到下一个制表位，即分隔输入字段"

msgid "**; (semicolon)** end of record, i.e. a new record is started"
msgstr "**; (分号)** 记录结束，即开始一个新记录"

msgid ""
"**! (exclamation mark)** ignore rest of input line (useful for comments)"
msgstr "**! (感叹号)** 忽略输入行的其余部分（用于注释）"

msgid ""
"Input may be given upper or lower case. The input processor converts all "
"characters to upper case. All integers are appended with “.” (only floating "
"point numbers are read by the program)."
msgstr "输入可以是大写或小写。输入处理器将所有字符转换为大写。所有整数都会附加“.”（程序只读取浮点数）。"

msgid ""
"Several logical input records can actually be typed on one line and "
"separated by semicolons, i.e., a given input line may contain many actual "
"commands (separated by semicolons), or just one, as you prefer. These basic "
"command units (records) delimited by semicolons are also frequently referred"
" to as *cards* throughout this manual."
msgstr ""
"实际上，多个逻辑输入记录可以输入在一行中，并用分号分隔，也就是说，一个给定的输入行可以包含许多实际命令（用分号分隔），或者只有一个，这取决于您的偏好。这些由分号分隔的基本命令单元（记录）在本手册中也常被称为\\"
" *卡片*\\ 。"

msgid "Exception to these general rules are:"
msgstr "这些通用规则的例外情况是："

msgid "``***`` first data line always (can be omitted)"
msgstr "``***`` 始终为第一行数据（可以省略）"

msgid "``INCLUDE`` include other input file"
msgstr "``INCLUDE`` 包含其他输入文件"

msgid "``FILE`` definition of named files"
msgstr "``FILE`` 定义命名文件"

msgid "``TEXT`` prints text"
msgstr "``TEXT`` 打印文本"

msgid "``TITLE`` defines a title for the run or a table"
msgstr "``TITLE`` 为运行或表格定义标题"

msgid "``CON`` specifies orbital configurations"
msgstr "``CON`` 指定轨道组态"

msgid "``---`` last line of input"
msgstr "``---`` 输入的最后一行"

msgid ""
"These commands always occupy a whole line. Using ``INCLUDE`` it is possible "
"to open secondary input files. If an ``INCLUDE`` command is encountered, the"
" new input file is opened and read until its end. Input is then continued "
"after the include card in the first file. ``INCLUDE``\\ ’s may be nested."
msgstr ""
"这些命令总是占据一整行。使用 ``INCLUDE`` 可以打开辅助输入文件。如果遇到 ``INCLUDE`` "
"命令，新的输入文件将被打开并读取至文件末尾。然后，输入将在第一个文件的包含卡片之后继续。\\ ``INCLUDE`` 可以嵌套。"

msgid ""
"A Molpro input record (card) contains a number of input *fields*. Input "
"fields may be up to 256 characters wide and contain either expressions or "
"strings. The fields can be separated by commas or blanks. We recommend the "
"general use of commas in order to avoid unexpected results."
msgstr ""
"一个 Molpro 输入记录（卡片）包含若干输入\\ *字段*\\ 。输入字段最多可包含 256 "
"个字符，内容可以是表达式或字符串。字段之间可以用逗号或空格分隔。我们建议通常使用逗号，以避免意外结果。"

msgid ""
"Each line may start with a label. A label is separated from the body of the "
"line by a colon (:). The colon is part of the label. The length of the label"
" must not exceed 6 characters (including the colon) and the labels must be "
"unique. Labels may be useful with ``GOTO`` commands. Example:"
msgstr ""
"每行可以以一个标签开头。标签通过冒号 (:) 与行的主体部分分隔。冒号是标签的一部分。标签长度不得超过 6 个字符（包括冒号），且标签必须唯一。标签在与"
" ``GOTO`` 命令配合使用时可能有用。例如："

msgid "Here ``START:`` is a label, and ``CCSD(T)`` is a command."
msgstr "这里 ``START:`` 是一个标签，而 ``CCSD(T)`` 是一个命令。"

msgid ""
"Input lines may be concatenated using :math:`\\backslash` at the end of the "
"line(s) to be continued. Any number of lines may be concatenated up to a "
"total length of 1024 characters (only 500 characters are possible on older "
"IBM systems)."
msgstr ""
"输入行可以通过在需要续行的行末使用 :math:`\\backslash` "
"进行连接。最多可以连接任意数量的行，总长度可达1024个字符（在较旧的IBM系统上仅支持500个字符）。"

msgid ""
"Filenames may be up to 31 characters long, provided that long filenames are "
"supported by the Unix system used. An exception are older CRAY systems, "
"which allow only 8 characters for the names of binary Molpro files."
msgstr ""
"文件名最多可包含31个字符，前提是所使用的Unix系统支持长文件名。例外情况是较旧的CRAY系统，其二进制Molpro文件的名称仅允许8个字符。"

msgid "Commands"
msgstr "命令"

msgid "The general format is either"
msgstr "通用格式为"

msgid "``COMMAND, options``"
msgstr "``COMMAND,options``"

msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

msgid ""
"Examples for commands are ``HF, MP2, CCSD(T), MCSCF, MRCI``. Examples for "
"directives are ``OCC, CLOSED, WF, PRINT``. Directives can be in any order, "
"unless otherwise noted. Data can follow certain directives. For the format "
"of options, directives and data see subsections `directives "
"<definition_of_molpro_input_language.html#directives>`__, `options "
"<definition_of_molpro_input_language.html#options>`__, and `data "
"<definition_of_molpro_input_language.html#data>`__, respectively."
msgstr ""
"命令的示例包括 ``HF, MP2, CCSD(T), MCSCF, MRCI``\\ 。指令的示例包括 ``OCC, CLOSED, WF, "
"PRINT``\\ 。除非另有说明，指令可以按任意顺序排列。数据可以跟在某些指令之后。关于选项、指令和数据的格式，请分别参见子章节 "
"`directives <definition_of_molpro_input_language.html#directives>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`options <definition_of_molpro_input_language.html#options>`__ 和 `data "
"<definition_of_molpro_input_language.html#data>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"In the following, such a sequence of input will be denoted a *command "
"block*. Special command blocks are the geometry and basis blocks."
msgstr "在下文中，这样的输入序列将被称为\\ *命令块*\\ 。特殊的命令块是几何结构和基组块。"

msgid ""
"The options given on the command line may include any options relevant to "
"the current program. For instance, in DF-LMP2-R12 this could be options for "
"density fitting, local, explicit, and/or thresholds. Alternatively, options "
"can be specified on individual directives like"
msgstr ""
"命令行上给出的选项可以包括与当前程序相关的任何选项。例如，在 DF-LMP2-R12 "
"中，这可能是用于密度拟合、局域化、显式相关和/或阈值的选项。或者，选项可以在单独的指令上指定，例如"

msgid ""
"In these cases, only the options belong to the corresponding directive are "
"valid; thus, if an option for ``EXPLICIT`` would be specified, e.g., on the "
"``DFIT`` directive, an error would result. This error would be detected "
"already in the input prechecking stage."
msgstr ""
"在这些情况下，只有属于相应指令的选项才是有效的；因此，如果指定了\\ ``EXPLICIT``\\ 的选项，例如在\\ ``DFIT``\\ "
"指令上，将会导致错误。此错误在输入预检查阶段就会被检测到。"

msgid ""
"As already mentioned, the use of curly brackets is normally compulsory if "
"more than one input line is needed. In the case of one-line commands, curly "
"brackets are needed as well if the next command or procedure has the same "
"name as a directive valid for the current command."
msgstr "如前所述，如果需要多行输入，通常必须使用花括号。对于单行命令，如果下一个命令或过程与当前命令的有效指令同名，也需要使用花括号。"

msgid ""
"Note: ``DIRECT`` and associated options cannot be specified on command lines"
" any more."
msgstr "注意：\\ ``DIRECT``\\ 及其关联选项不能再在命令行中指定。"

msgid "Directives"
msgstr "指令"

msgid ""
"Directives serve to specify input data and special options for programs. "
"They start with a keyword, followed by data and/or options. The general "
"format is"
msgstr "指令用于为程序指定输入数据和特殊选项。它们以一个关键字开始，后跟数据和/或选项。通用格式为"

msgid ""
"The format of data and options is specified in the subsequent sections. Data"
" must always be given before any options."
msgstr "数据和选项的格式在后续章节中指定。数据必须始终在任何选项之前给出。"

msgid "Examples for directives are"
msgstr "指令的示例包括"

msgid "Global directives"
msgstr "全局指令"

msgid ""
"Certain directives can be given anywhere in the input, i.e. either inside or"
" outside command blocks. If they are given inside of command blocks, the "
"specified options are valid only locally for the current program. However, "
"if they are given outside a command block, they act globally, and are used "
"for all programs executed after the input has been encountered. Local "
"options have preference over global options."
msgstr ""
"某些指令可以在输入中的任何位置给出，即可以在命令块内部或外部。如果它们在命令块内部给出，指定的选项仅对当前程序局部有效。然而，如果在命令块外部给出，它们将全局生效，并用于在遇到该输入后执行的所有程序。局部选项优先于全局选项。"

msgid "The following directives can be either local or global:"
msgstr "以下指令可以是局部的或全局的："

msgid ""
"If such options are given outside a command block, a context can be "
"specified"
msgstr "如果此类选项在命令块外部给出，则可以指定一个上下文"

msgid "e.g.,"
msgstr "例如，"

msgid ""
"If no context is given, the default is ``HF``. The default occupations for "
"single reference methods (e.g., MP2, CCSD) are the ones used in ``HF``, the "
"defaults for multireference methods (e.g. RS2, MRCI) correspond to those "
"used in ``MCSCF``."
msgstr ""
"如果未指定上下文，则默认为 ``HF``\\ 。单参考方法（例如，MP2、CCSD）的默认占据数使用 ``HF`` "
"中的设置，多参考方法（例如，RS2、MRCI）的默认占据数则对应于 ``MCSCF`` 中使用的设置。"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "Options have the general form ``NAME``\\ [=\\ *value*]"
msgstr "选项的一般形式为 ``NAME``\\ [=\\ *value*]"

msgid ""
"where value can be a number, and expression, or a string. Several options "
"are separated by comma or blank. ``NAME`` must begin with a character [A-Z]."
" If options are given on a ``COMMAND`` line or on directives within a "
"command block, they are valid only for the corresponding program (see Sec. "
"`directives <definition_of_molpro_input_language.html#directives>`__). If "
"options are given in a procedure, they are valid only in the procedure and "
"procedures called from the current procedure; whenever a procedure is "
"terminated, the options of the previous level are restored."
msgstr ""
"其中值可以是数字、表达式或字符串。多个选项用逗号或空格分隔。\\ ``NAME`` 必须以字符 [A-Z] 开头。如果选项在 ``COMMAND`` "
"行上或命令块内的指令中给出，则它们仅对相应的程序有效（参见章节 `directives "
"<definition_of_molpro_input_language.html#directives>`__\\ "
"）。如果选项在过程中给出，则它们仅在该过程以及从当前过程调用的过程中有效；每当一个过程终止时，将恢复上一级的选项。"

msgid ""
"Options can also be single keywords, like ``SYM`` or ``NOSYM``. In this "
"case, the option is switched on or off, depending whether or not the key "
"begins with ``NO``. Alternatively, such logical options can also be set or "
"unset using ``NAME=ON`` or ``NAME=OFF``. For instance, ``SYM=OFF`` is "
"equivalent to ``NOSYM``. Furthermore, ``YES`` and ``NO`` are aliases for "
"``ON`` and ``OFF``, respectively."
msgstr ""
"选项也可以是单个关键字，例如 ``SYM`` 或 ``NOSYM``\\ 。在这种情况下，选项会根据关键字是否以 ``NO`` "
"开头而打开或关闭。或者，也可以使用 ``NAME=ON`` 或 ``NAME=OFF`` 来设置或取消设置此类逻辑选项。例如，\\ "
"``SYM=OFF`` 等同于 ``NOSYM``\\ 。此外，\\ ``YES`` 和 ``NO`` 分别是 ``ON`` 和 ``OFF`` "
"的别名。"

msgid "Data"
msgstr "数据"

msgid ""
"Data are defined as a sequence of numbers, expressions, or strings, "
"separated by commas or blanks. Generally, the order of data is essential. "
"Empty fields are interpreted as zeros. Strings and variables must begin with"
" a character [A-Z]. If :math:`+` or :math:`-` follows blank and directly "
"precedes a number or variable it is interpreted as sign and not a binary "
"operator. If there are no blanks before and after such operators, or blanks "
"follow them, they are interpreted as binary operators. Examples:"
msgstr ""
"数据被定义为一串由逗号或空格分隔的数字、表达式或字符串。通常，数据的顺序至关重要。空字段被解释为零。字符串和变量必须以字符 [A-Z] 开头。如果 "
":math:`+` 或 :math:`-` "
"紧跟在空格之后并直接位于数字或变量之前，它将被解释为符号而非二元运算符。如果此类运算符前后没有空格，或者空格跟在它们后面，它们将被解释为二元运算符。示例："

msgid "yields [-1,4]"
msgstr "得到 [-1,4]"

msgid "yields [3,-4,4]"
msgstr "得到 [3,-4,4]"

msgid "Expressions (including numbers) may contain variables."
msgstr "表达式（包括数字）可以包含变量。"

msgid ""
"Examples for the use of data: geometry and basis input, ``LATTICE``, "
"``OCC``, ``CLOSED``, ``CORE``, ``WF`` directives."
msgstr ""
"数据使用的示例：几何和基组输入，\\ ``LATTICE``\\ 、\\ ``OCC``\\ 、\\ ``CLOSED``\\ 、\\ "
"``CORE``\\ 、\\ ``WF`` 指令。"

msgid ""
"In some cases several lines of data are needed for a certain command or "
"directive; in such cases the data must follow directly the corresponding "
"command\\ :math:`|`\\ directive, and must be enclosed in square brackets:"
msgstr "在某些情况下，某个命令或指令需要多行数据；在这种情况下，数据必须紧跟在相应的命令\\ :math:`|`\\ 指令之后，并且必须用方括号括起来："

msgid ""
"Normally, the input format of data is ``MOLPRO`` style, i.e., numbers are "
"separated by commas, and variables as well as expressions can be used."
msgstr "通常，数据的输入格式为 ``MOLPRO`` 风格，即数字用逗号分隔，并且可以使用变量和表达式。"

msgid ""
"If data are included using external files, the input format of *data* is "
"free format: no commas are needed, but no variables and expressions can be "
"used."
msgstr "如果数据通过外部文件包含，则 *data* 的输入格式为自由格式：不需要逗号，但不能使用变量和表达式。"

msgid "Expressions"
msgstr "表达式"

msgid "[sec:expressions]"
msgstr "[sec:expressions]"

msgid "The following standard operations can be performed :"
msgstr "可以执行以下标准操作："

msgid "Intrinsic functions"
msgstr "内置函数"

msgid "Expressions may contain the following intrinsic functions:"
msgstr "表达式可包含以下内置函数："

msgid "``ABS(expr)`` Absolute value"
msgstr "``ABS(expr)`` 绝对值"

msgid ""
"``MAX(expr,expr, ...)`` Largest value of arbitrary number of numbers or "
"expressions"
msgstr "``MAX(expr,expr, ...)`` 任意数量数值或表达式中的最大值"

msgid ""
"``MIN(expr,expr, ...)`` Smallest value of arbitrary number of numbers of "
"expressions"
msgstr "``MIN(expr,expr, ...)`` 任意数量数值或表达式中的最小值"

msgid "``EXP(expr)`` Exponential"
msgstr "``EXP(expr)`` 指数函数"

msgid "``LOG(expr)`` Natural Logarithm"
msgstr "``LOG(expr)`` 自然对数"

msgid "``LOG10(expr)`` Common Logarithm"
msgstr "``LOG10(expr)`` 常用对数"

msgid "``SQRT(expr)`` Square Root"
msgstr "``SQRT(expr)`` 平方根"

msgid "``NINT(expr)`` Next nearest integer"
msgstr "``NINT(expr)`` 最近整数"

msgid "``INT(expr)`` Truncate to integer"
msgstr "``INT(expr)`` 截断为整数"

msgid "``SIN(expr)`` Sine"
msgstr "``SIN(expr)`` 正弦"

msgid "``COS(expr)`` Cosine"
msgstr "``COS(expr)`` 余弦"

msgid "``TAN(expr)`` Tangent"
msgstr "``TAN(expr)`` 正切"

msgid "``ASIN(expr)`` Arcsine"
msgstr "``ASIN(expr)`` 反正弦"

msgid "``ACOS(expr)`` Arccosine"
msgstr "``ACOS(expr)`` 反余弦"

msgid "``ATAN(expr)`` Arctangent"
msgstr "``ATAN(expr)`` 反正切"

msgid "``COSH(expr)`` Hyperbolic cosine"
msgstr "``COSH(expr)`` 双曲余弦"

msgid "``SINH(expr)`` Hyperbolic sine"
msgstr "``SINH(expr)`` 双曲正弦"

msgid "``TANH(expr)`` Hyperbolic tangent"
msgstr "``TANH(expr)`` 双曲正切"

msgid "``MOD(expr1 , expr2 )`` Remainder: ``expr1-INT(expr1/expr2)*expr2``"
msgstr "``MOD(expr1 , expr2 )`` 余数：\\ ``expr1-INT(expr1/expr2)*expr2``"

msgid "Note: all trigonometric functions use or produce angles in degrees."
msgstr "注意：所有三角函数使用或产生的角度均以度为单位。"

msgid "Variables"
msgstr "变量"

msgid "[sec:variables1]"
msgstr "[sec:variables1]"

msgid "Setting variables"
msgstr "设置变量"

msgid ""
"Data and results can be stored in Molpro variables. Variables can be of type"
" string, floating, or logical and may be used anywhere in the input."
msgstr "数据和结果可以存储在 Molpro 变量中。变量可以是字符串、浮点数或逻辑类型，并且可以在输入中的任何地方使用。"

msgid "The syntax for setting variables is"
msgstr "设置变量的语法是"

msgid "where unit is optional. If a variable is undefined, zero is assumed."
msgstr "其中单位是可选的。如果变量未定义，则假定为零。"

msgid "String variables"
msgstr "字符串变量"

msgid ""
"Special care is necessary when using strings. In order to avoid unexpected "
"results, either a $ has to be prefixed whenever a string variable is set, or"
" the string has to be given in quotes. Possible forms are"
msgstr "使用字符串时需要特别注意。为了避免意外结果，在设置字符串变量时，要么必须在前面加上$符号，要么必须将字符串放在引号中。可能的形式有"

msgid "yields"
msgstr "产生"

msgid ""
"For more information concerning strings and string variables, see section "
"`string variables <variables.html#string-variables>`__"
msgstr ""
"有关字符串和字符串变量的更多信息，请参阅章节 `string variables <variables.html#string-"
"variables>`__"

msgid "Procedures"
msgstr "过程"

msgid "Procedure definition"
msgstr "过程定义"

msgid ""
"Procedures are sequences of commands and/or options. They can be defined "
"anywhere in the input as"
msgstr "过程是命令和/或选项的序列。它们可以在输入中的任何位置定义为"

msgid ""
"In order to avoid unexpected results, *procname* must differ from all known "
"command names. Procedures must not contain geometry blocks."
msgstr "为避免意外结果，\\ *procname* 必须与所有已知命令名称不同。过程不得包含几何块。"

msgid ""
"Note that procedures are not executed when encountered in the input, but "
"only when called. Procedure definitions must not be nested. Procedures can "
"contain procedure calls up to a nesting level of 10."
msgstr "请注意，过程在输入中遇到时不会执行，仅在调用时执行。过程定义不得嵌套。过程可以包含过程调用，嵌套级别最多为10。"

msgid "Procedure calls"
msgstr "过程调用"

msgid ""
"Procedures can be called anywhere in the input. The syntax is the same as "
"for commands (cf. section `commands "
"<definition_of_molpro_input_language.html#commands>`__), except that the "
"procedure name replaces the command name."
msgstr ""
"过程可以在输入中的任何位置调用。其语法与命令相同（参见 `commands "
"<definition_of_molpro_input_language.html#commands>`__ 节），只是用过程名称替换命令名称。"

msgid "``PROCEDURE``"
msgstr "``PROCEDURE``"

msgid ""
"No options are allowed on procedure calls. However, specific options may be "
"set using directives within the procedure, and these are then valid for all "
"programs within the procedure which follow the directive. When execution of "
"the procedure is finished, the previous global options are restored. The "
"hierarchy in which options are processed is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"过程调用不允许使用选项。但是，可以在过程内部使用指令设置特定选项，这些选项随后对指令之后过程内的所有程序有效。当过程执行完毕后，会恢复之前的全局选项。处理选项的层次结构如下："
